sim "HR help desk at payroll close"
lang en
horizon 1 day
currency USD

arrive request 30/hour during 8h-17h peak 9h-11h x2
pool analysts $analysts shift 8h-17h
step answer by analysts time ~5min cost 4

end answered
end gave_up
answer -> answered
answer abandon after 30min -> gave_up

knob analysts 2..8 = 3
scenario "One more analyst": analysts = 4

show wait p90 at answer
show count end gave_up
show utilization analysts

labels en:
  request: Request
  answer: HR analyst
  answered: Answered
  gave_up: Gave up
  analysts: Analysts
labels pt-BR:
  request: Solicitação
  answer: Analista de RH
  answered: Atendida
  gave_up: Desistiu
  analysts: Analistas
